    "value_statement": "Marketing teams can lose track of approved claims, offer terms, and supporting evidence. This skill records them in an append-only registry with disclosures, review dates, and provenance.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude",
      "Codex",
      "Claude Code",
